  <title>Detailed Syllabus</title>

  <!-- Include chapters -->
  <section xml:id="sec-course-info">
    <title>Course Information</title>

    <p>
      This is a more detailed syllabus for the accelerated, online version of <term>Linear Algebra (MATH 312)</term>, a 4-credit course offered through St. Cloud State University.
      <!-- use a description list (dl) for short items -->
      <dl>
        <li>
          <title>Instructor</title>

          <p>
            Dr. Dale Buske, CH 367A, <url href="mailto:drbuske@stcloudstate.edu" visual="drbuske@stcloudstate.edu"/>.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <title>Student Hours</title>

          <p>
            Available via Zoom by appointment.  Meetings on campus are also possible.  Email to set up a day, time, and method to meet.  
          </p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <title>Accessibility Services</title>
          <p>Please contact Student Accessibility Services (SAS), <url href="mailto:sas@stcloudstate.edu" visual="sas@stcloudstate.edu"/> or 320-308-4080, Centennial Hall 202, to meet and discuss reasonable and appropriate accommodations.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <title>Class Meetings</title>

          <p>
            The course is asynchronous. Following the online schedule is critical your success.   
          </p>

